    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban use of AI for under 13s",
        "additional_details": "We believe AI frequently leads people to false information. We are concerned by reports that it has encouraged suicide multiple times. We feel under 13s don't fully understand that they're supporting something that may be damaging their future so much. We think this law could be enforced using age verification tools.",
        "background": "Introduce law restricting use of AI to those age 13 and over ",
